    <p>1. The following are prohibited on Wesal:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Impersonation, fake accounts, and concealing an existing marriage where this misleads another person</li>
        <li>Fraud, requests for money or gifts, and requests for bank details</li>
        <li>Harassment, threats, blackmail, insults and discrimination</li>
        <li>Sexual, nude, violent or unlawful content</li>
        <li>Publishing another person's photos or data without permission, or content for which you do not own the rights</li>
        <li>Advertising, selling, commercial use, and paid marriage or matchmaking offers</li>
        <li>Placing phone numbers, external links or social-media accounts in your profile</li>
        <li>Copying members' data, collecting it automatically, or technically manipulating the application</li>
    </ul>
    <ol start="2">
