<section class="legal-section" id="terms-6">
    <h2>6. Contract formation and payment</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>When you register, a free contract is formed for use of the basic features.</li>
        <li>A paid contract is formed when you click the button “zahlungspflichtig bestellen” (in English: “Place order with obligation to pay”). Before doing so, you can review and correct your order.</li>
        <li>After the order, we send you a confirmation inside the application and a copy to your email address. It includes the contract details, these Terms and cancellation instructions. We retain the contract text, and you may request it at any time.</li>
        <li>Payment is made in advance through Stripe using the methods displayed there. There are no automatic recurring charges.</li>
        <li>If payment fails, we notify you. The paid service does not begin until payment has been completed.</li>
        <li>The contract language is Arabic or English, according to the language of the application you use.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section class="legal-section" id="terms-7">
    <h2>7. Duration and termination</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>A free account has no fixed duration. You may end it at any time by deleting your account.</li>
        <li>All paid plans (weekly trial, monthly, three months, VIP and one-time publication) are purchased once and do not renew. They end automatically when their duration expires or the service has been completed. No cancellation is required and no further payment is taken. To extend a plan, you must purchase a new one yourself.</li>
        <li>Because plans do not renew, there is no need to cancel them. If you wish to stop before the end of a plan, you may permanently delete your account at any time. All plans then end with the account and no further payment is taken.</li>
        <li>Deleting your account does not entitle you to a refund for the unused part of a paid period, except during the withdrawal period under section 8 or where required by law.</li>
        <li>Both parties retain the right to terminate immediately for good cause and any other termination right granted by law. You may exercise this right by emailing <a href="mailto:wesalsyrien@gmail.com">wesalsyrien@gmail.com</a> or writing to the address in section 1. We will send written confirmation. For us, good cause includes serious violations listed in section 10.</li>
        <li>If we terminate the contract because of your serious breach, we refund the amount paid only to the extent required by law. If we terminate for a reason not attributable to you, we refund the paid portion relating to the unused period.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

